[32m+[m[32m﻿Commit Messages for Bug Fixes[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mExample of a good bug-fix commit message:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mFix login error when users enter an invalid password[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mCharacteristics of a well-written commit message:[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m1. Clear and specific[m
[32m+[m[32m   It clearly explains what was changed.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m2. Short and concise[m
[32m+[m[32m   It describes the change directly without unnecessary information.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m3. Uses an action word[m
[32m+[m[32m   It begins with an action word such as Fix, Add, Update, Remove, or Improve.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32m4. Relevant to the change[m
[32m+[m[32m   It accurately describes the changes made.[m
[32m+[m
[32m+[m[32mA good commit message helps team members understand the project's history.[m[41m[m
